#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "A CV downloaded as a Europass file, for a portal or a service that reads the European CV format: its entries and the details it prints, in its language. What Europass has no place for is said beside the download. Switched off, the download is not offered and its address answers as if there were nothing there."
msgstr "CV íoslódáilte mar chomhad Europass, do thairseach nó do sheirbhís a léann formáid CV na hEorpa: a iontrálacha agus na sonraí a phriontálann sé, ina theanga. Deirtear cad nach bhfuil áit dó in Europass in aice leis an íoslódáil. Má tá sé múchta, ní thairgtear an íoslódáil agus freagraíonn a seoladh amhail is nach raibh aon rud ann."

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "A CV downloaded as a JSON Resume file, the open format many CV tools and themes read: its entries and the details it prints. What the format has no place for is said beside the download. Switched off, the download is not offered and its address answers as if there were nothing there."
msgstr "CV íoslódáilte mar chomhad JSON Resume, an fhormáid oscailte a léann go leor uirlisí agus téamaí CV: a iontrálacha agus na sonraí a phriontálann sé. Deirtear cad nach bhfuil áit dó san fhormáid in aice leis an íoslódáil. Má tá sé múchta, ní thairgtear an íoslódáil agus freagraíonn a seoladh amhail is nach raibh aon rud ann."

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "Add publications to the bibliography import by typing their DOIs: one request to doi.org for each, when you press for it, which passes the DOI to Crossref or DataCite. Nothing else about you is sent. Off until an administrator switches it on, because every DOI typed tells doi.org, and so whoever runs this, what somebody here is reading; it also needs Publication lookups. Switched off, nothing is asked and a file is still read."
msgstr "Cuir foilseacháin leis an iompórtáil leabharliosta trína DOInna a chlóscríobh: iarratas amháin chuig doi.org do gach ceann, nuair a bhrúnn tú an cnaipe, a sheolann an DOI ar aghaidh chuig Crossref nó DataCite. Ní sheoltar aon rud eile fút. Múchta go dtí go gcasann riarthóir ar siúl é, mar go n-insíonn gach DOI a chlóscríobhtar do doi.org, agus mar sin don té a reáchtálann é seo, cad atá duine éigin anseo ag léamh; teastaíonn Cuardach foilseachán uaidh freisin. Má tá sé múchta, ní chuirtear aon cheist agus léitear comhad fós."

